# "Untap another target artifact" (CR 115.1): the Key itself is refused as the target (the refusal) beside a Sol Ring, which is
# not. The Sol Ring tapped for {C}{C} pays the Key's {1}, is untapped by it, and is tapped once more for mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Manifold Key
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Manifold Key.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Manifold Key.Activate(Manifold Key; Ability: Untap)
Bot1.Battlefield.Manifold Key.Activate(Sol Ring; Ability: Untap)
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Manifold Key.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Tapped = true
